scavenger march ash~
a gaunt march-scavenger~
A gaunt march-scavenger drags a sack of scrap through the ash.
~
    Bent under a load of rusted iron and wearing the remains of three
different uniforms, the scavenger watches you with the flat appraisal
of someone who has long since worked out what a body is worth by the
pound.  Nothing about the Marches surprises this one any more.
~
