#3022
reaver salt field~
the Salt-Field Reaver~
A huge figure in salt-crusted plate wades out of the ash.
~
    Once a champion of one of the armies that ruined this plain, the
Reaver still wears the harness it died in, and the salt of the fields
has grown over the joints in white scabs.  It carries a beheading
sword in one fist and drags the other behind it, and it kills
anything that crosses the furrows it walks.
~
