#3042
serren last banner~
Serren, the Last Banner~
Serren, the Last Banner, stands at the head of the hall.
~
    The last officer of Fort Sunder still holds the hall her garrison
died defending, and she does not know that the war is over.  Her
armour is grey plate gone black at the joints, the standard of the
fort is wound about her left arm, and her sword has been sharpened so
many times that the blade is a hand's width too narrow.  She offers
every stranger one chance to leave.
~
